Recommends: myna,
Description: Whisper speech-to-text engine for Myna (CPU)
 Local, offline speech-to-text service for the Myna dictation daemon. It runs
 OpenAI Whisper models through faster-whisper (CTranslate2) on the CPU and
 serves the Myna session protocol on a Unix socket in
 $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/myna/whisper/, where myna-desktop finds it.
 .
 No model is shipped: download one with `myna-whisper-fetch-model base`
 (tiny, base or small), then enable the myna-whisper.service user unit.
 .
 The Python runtime (faster-whisper, CTranslate2, PyAV, NumPy...) is bundled
 in /usr/lib/myna-whisper, built from the upstream uv.lock for Python 3.13.
